Package: libmd
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Depends: libsystem
Description: message digest library (FreeBSD API)
 FreeBSD's message digest API on CommonCrypto, with MD4, MD5, SHA-0,
 SHA-1, SHA-224, SHA-256, SHA-384 and SHA-512 helpers.
 .
 MD4 is the "RSA Data Security, Inc. MD4 Message-Digest Algorithm".
 MD5 is the "RSA Data Security, Inc. MD5 Message-Digest Algorithm".

Package: libmd-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libmd (= ${binary:Version})
Description: message digest library (FreeBSD API): development files
 Headers for building programs against libmd.
